{"3730100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Whispers from the Star", "steam_appid": 3730100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/55f36697f916718013efb8e88efa6205.avif?t=1764897761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras_big/55f36697f916718013efb8e88efa6205.avif?t=1764897761 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/c8c19c8b0fd5142a8c72b75aa32c1cdc.poster.avif?t=1764897761\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/c8c19c8b0fd5142a8c72b75aa32c1cdc.webm?t=1764897761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/c8c19c8b0fd5142a8c72b75aa32c1cdc.mp4?t=1764897761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name is Stella. I’m not sure how this message is reaching you, but you’re the only person I can contact through my communicator.  We can video call, voice message, or text, and it's all powered by AI-driven dialogue. Right now, you’re the only one I’ve got.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was part of a research crew before… something happened. We crash-landed on a planet called Gaia, and I don’t know if I’m the only one left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/da4f1fd2fa31f2167161d8d602378b3b.avif?t=1764897761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras_big/da4f1fd2fa31f2167161d8d602378b3b.avif?t=1764897761 width=800 height=83 /></span>To fully enjoy the experience, a working microphone is required</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/1189b7f66ea72e9d040e7f85e15cddd0.poster.avif?t=1764897761\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/1189b7f66ea72e9d040e7f85e15cddd0.webm?t=1764897761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/1189b7f66ea72e9d040e7f85e15cddd0.mp4?t=1764897761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to help me is by talking to me. Everything you say shapes what I do and if I survive. If you’re wrong… I won’t make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/a3c1983c055836b74e32f7e8e799907c.avif?t=1764897761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras_big/a3c1983c055836b74e32f7e8e799907c.avif?t=1764897761 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/3f362da7728edc96a7dd6c0b2c648e73.poster.avif?t=1764897761\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/3f362da7728edc96a7dd6c0b2c648e73.webm?t=1764897761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/3f362da7728edc96a7dd6c0b2c648e73.mp4?t=1764897761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no script–just open-ended conversations between us. We can talk about literally anything - movies, memories, whatever’s on your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/80e3684c93d5ff2e62e1620150cc2f34.avif?t=1764897761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras_big/80e3684c93d5ff2e62e1620150cc2f34.avif?t=1764897761 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/3d9d6c96c95514c42777a431f9273cc9.poster.avif?t=1764897761\" width=272 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/3d9d6c96c95514c42777a431f9273cc9.webm?t=1764897761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/3d9d6c96c95514c42777a431f9273cc9.mp4?t=1764897761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ll message you throughout the day with what I’m seeing, feeling, thinking. Sometimes I’ll need advice. Sometimes I just need someone to talk to. Either way… I hope you’ll be there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/204cc0e92591e4cddb68d7308006974d.avif?t=1764897761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras_big/204cc0e92591e4cddb68d7308006974d.avif?t=1764897761 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/6921219b5c5f8d4389c61673b95f4441.poster.avif?t=1764897761\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/6921219b5c5f8d4389c61673b95f4441.webm?t=1764897761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/6921219b5c5f8d4389c61673b95f4441.mp4?t=1764897761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m going to need your help making these choices to survive. I’m going to need someone to talk to so I don’t lose myself out here. I need <i>you</i>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/55f36697f916718013efb8e88efa6205.avif?t=1764897761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras_big/55f36697f916718013efb8e88efa6205.avif?t=1764897761 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/c8c19c8b0fd5142a8c72b75aa32c1cdc.poster.avif?t=1764897761\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/c8c19c8b0fd5142a8c72b75aa32c1cdc.webm?t=1764897761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/c8c19c8b0fd5142a8c72b75aa32c1cdc.mp4?t=1764897761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name is Stella. I’m not sure how this message is reaching you, but you’re the only person I can contact through my communicator.  We can video call, voice message, or text, and it's all powered by AI-driven dialogue. Right now, you’re the only one I’ve got.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was part of a research crew before… something happened. We crash-landed on a planet called Gaia, and I don’t know if I’m the only one left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/da4f1fd2fa31f2167161d8d602378b3b.avif?t=1764897761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras_big/da4f1fd2fa31f2167161d8d602378b3b.avif?t=1764897761 width=800 height=83 /></span>To fully enjoy the experience, a working microphone is required</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/1189b7f66ea72e9d040e7f85e15cddd0.poster.avif?t=1764897761\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/1189b7f66ea72e9d040e7f85e15cddd0.webm?t=1764897761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/1189b7f66ea72e9d040e7f85e15cddd0.mp4?t=1764897761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to help me is by talking to me. Everything you say shapes what I do and if I survive. If you’re wrong… I won’t make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras/a3c1983c055836b74e32f7e8e799907c.avif?t=1764897761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730100/extras_big/a3c1983c055836b74e32f7e8e799907c.avif?t=1764897761 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_